-- #847 phase 1 (lane X, 2026-10-21): the stale continent travel nodes of lane Fs audit (playerbots DB; beyond AC -
-- ACs graph is 3.3.5 data and this graph is ACs rows stamped 5.4.8-1).
--
-- Lane Fs audit found 131 continent walk
-- nodes with no 5.4.8 navmesh under them (map 0: 30, 1: 55, 530: 16, 571: 30). Each one, offline, over the servers own
-- data (mmaps, DBCs, world DB):
--  - an innkeeper / flightMaster / spirithealer node is re-anchored on the 5.4.8 spawn with that npcflag within 150 yd
--    (the AC generateNpcNodes anchor), a boss-named node on the 5.4.8 spawn of that creature, an area-trigger node on
--    its 5.4.8 AreaTrigger.dbc / areatrigger_teleport position; zone-mean nodes keep their own position;
--  - the anchor is moved onto the nearest walkable point (bot filter: ground + water, no magma/slime) that lies in
--    a big navmesh component (>= 3000 polys; the plain nearest poly is often a roof / rock island no path leaves):
--    NPC nodes within 12 yd, trigger nodes within 20 yd of the trigger centre or the old node (AC buildPaths
--    20 yd portal reach), zone-mean nodes within 40 yd / 80 yd vertical (ground preferred over water);
--  - no 5.4.8 NPC / no navmesh -> the node is dropped with every link and path row that touches it;
--  - every walk link of a moved node is rebuilt: Detour A* (bot filter, water area cost 20) between the two nodes,
--    funnel (findStraightPath), points every <= 15 yd, the exact node positions as first / last point, the AC
--    TravelNodePath::calculateCost values (distance from 0.1, swim distance, max creature levels from the 5.4.8
--    spawns within 50 yd); a link with no navmesh path is deleted (both directions);
--  - a moved node left with no walk link in or out is dropped too (no bot can walk to or from it);
--  - portal (type 2) path end points follow their moved node; flight-path (type 4) rows are the taxi path and stay.
-- Transport stops are not moved: they sit on the transport deck by design (AuditTransportStops checks them).
-- Result: 101 nodes moved, 27 dropped, 3 transport stops kept; 619 walk links rebuilt, 64 deleted.
-- Every row is linked / calculated = 1, so TravelNodeMap::LoadOrGenerate keeps the stored graph (no regeneration).
-- Apply after 2026_10_15_00.sql, 2026_10_21_laneF_787.sql and 2026_10_21_laneF_846.sql.
-- Generator: phase1.py, emit1.py (tg_nav.py = the offline Detour).
-- Undo: run the matching undo script (restores every
--   touched node, link and path row as they were on the test DB on 2026-10-21, before lane F 787 / 846).

